        <mxCell id="n26" value="Strategy in action. BillingService never learns which rule ran. STANDARD, SURGICAL, COSMETIC and EMERGENCY each answer 6.2 and 6.3 differently, yet all four are called through the same line of code. Step 8 is deliberate duplication: the Java total and the SQL total are compared before the bill is issued." style="shape=note;size=18;fillColor=#FFF9E0;strokeColor=#C8B26B;strokeWidth=2;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;align=left;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24.0" y="968.0" width="736.0" height="124.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
